#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up an online lab environment to use Qiskit in the cloud. Choose a "
"preconfigured environment or set up your own."
msgstr ""
"Configura un entorno de laboratorio en línea para usar Qiskit en la nube. "
"Elige un entorno preconfigurado o configura el tuyo propio."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments"
msgstr "Entornos de laboratorio en línea"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments {#online-lab-environments}"
msgstr "Entornos de laboratorio en línea {#online-lab-environments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to downloading and installing Qiskit to work on your local "
"machine, there are several options available for those who prefer to work in"
" an online development environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Además de descargar e instalar Qiskit para trabajar en tu máquina local, "
"existen varias opciones disponibles para quienes prefieren trabajar en un "
"entorno de desarrollo en línea.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Several providers offer online Jupyter environments with Qiskit preinstalled"
" for fast and convenient onboarding. These recommended providers include the"
" cloud service provider OVHcloud and the quantum software development cloud "
"platform qBraid.\n"
msgstr ""
"Varios proveedores ofrecen entornos Jupyter en línea con Qiskit preinstalado"
" para un inicio rápido y conveniente. Entre los proveedores recomendados se "
"encuentran el proveedor de servicios en la nube OVHcloud y la plataforma de "
"desarrollo de software cuántico en la nube qBraid.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recommended notebook environments with Qiskit preinstalled {#recommended-"
"notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"
msgstr ""
"Entornos de notebooks recomendados con Qiskit preinstalado {#recommended-"
"notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional online Jupyter notebook environments like IBM Watson&reg; Studio,"
" Google Colab, and Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio can be used to "
"work with Qiskit by following the appropriate instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Otros entornos de Jupyter notebooks en línea, como IBM Watson&reg; Studio, "
"Google Colab y Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio, también pueden "
"usarse con Qiskit siguiendo las instrucciones correspondientes.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "OVHcloud AI notebooks {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"
msgstr "Notebooks de IA de OVHcloud {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"OVHcloud Public Cloud and OVHcloud Startup users can use their OVHcloud "
"quantum notebooks to access Qiskit and submit jobs to IBM&reg; QPUs with "
"their IBM Quantum&reg; or IBM Cloud&reg; account. To learn more, visit the "
"[OVHcloud Documentation and tutorials](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-"
"documentation?id=kb_home) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios de OVHcloud Public Cloud y OVHcloud Startup pueden utilizar sus"
" notebooks cuánticos de OVHcloud para acceder a Qiskit y enviar trabajos a "
"las QPUs de IBM&reg; con su cuenta de IBM Quantum&reg; o IBM Cloud&reg;. "
"Para obtener más información, visita la página de [documentación y "
"tutoriales de OVHcloud](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-"
"documentation?id=kb_home).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"OVHcloud AI notebooks are not available in some regions, such as the United States. Additionally, user interfaces might look different in different regions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Los notebooks de IA de OVHcloud no están disponibles en algunas regiones, como los Estados Unidos. Además, las interfaces de usuario pueden verse diferentes según la región.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to get started:\n"
msgstr "Sigue estos pasos para comenzar:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Crea una cuenta de IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set up an OVHcloud account](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-"
"create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Configura una cuenta de OVHcloud](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-"
"create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an OVH Public Cloud project](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea un proyecto de OVH Public "
"Cloud](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in [Launch your first AI "
"Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-"
"definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), selecting "
"**Qiskit** for the framework.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sigue los pasos en [Lanza tu primer AI "
"Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-"
"definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), seleccionando "
"**Qiskit** como framework.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"
msgstr "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit users can use qBraid's preconfigured Python environments by following"
" these instructions. For more information, see the [qBraid "
"Docs](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios de Qiskit pueden usar los entornos Python preconfigurados de "
"qBraid siguiendo estas instrucciones. Para más información, consulta la "
"[documentación de qBraid](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up an qBraid free account](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea una cuenta gratuita en "
"qBraid](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Lab environment](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-"
"started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea un entorno Lab](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-"
"started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launch qBraid Lab, click the **ENVS** icon on the right, click **+ ADD** at "
"the top of the new sidebar, and search for Qiskit.  Click the version you "
"want to use, then click **Install**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inicia qBraid Lab, haz clic en el ícono **ENVS** a la derecha, haz clic en "
"**+ ADD** en la parte superior de la nueva barra lateral y busca Qiskit. Haz"
" clic en la versión que deseas usar y luego en **Install**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a Jupyter notebook by clicking **Python 3 [Qiskit]** in the Notebook "
"section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Crea un Jupyter notebook haciendo clic en **Python 3 [Qiskit]** en la "
"sección Notebook.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can install any additional Python packages (Such as Qiskit v1.2) in a "
"notebook cell by running `%pip install [package_name].` For more "
"information, see the [Pip (magic) "
"commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-"
"commands) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Puedes instalar cualquier paquete adicional de Python (como Qiskit v1.2) en "
"una celda del notebook ejecutando `%pip install [package_name].` Para más "
"información, consulta el tema [Pip (magic) "
"commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-"
"commands).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional notebook environments for Qiskit users {#additional-notebook-"
"environments-for-qiskit-users}"
msgstr ""
"Entornos de notebooks adicionales para usuarios de Qiskit {#additional-"
"notebook-environments-for-qiskit-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For platforms without Qiskit preconfigured, the setup instructions are "
"similar, except that you must install Qiskit manually. You will create an "
"account, start a new project (or notebook or workspace, depending on the "
"platform), and install Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para plataformas sin Qiskit preconfigurado, las instrucciones de "
"configuración son similares, salvo que debes instalar Qiskit manualmente. "
"Tendrás que crear una cuenta, iniciar un nuevo proyecto (o notebook o "
"espacio de trabajo, según la plataforma) e instalar Qiskit.\n"

